# Store text files with LF line endings and check them out as LF on every
# platform. This overrides a machine-wide `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git for
# Windows default), so Windows Git and WSL/Linux Git agree on the working tree
# and a CRLF checkout can never surface as a whole-file phantom modification.
# Binary files (images, icons) are detected automatically and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
